      <body>
         <pb facs="loc_ew.00066.jpg" xml:id="leaf001r" type="recto"/>
         <lg type="poem">
            <head type="main" rend="underline">To the year 1889</head>
            <lg type="linegroup">
               <l>Have I no word for thee? <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">some</del> <add place="above" seq="2">no</add> <add place="above" seq="3"> <note type="authorial" place="inline">?</note>some</add></subst> fierce <del rend="overstrike">strong</del><lb/> yet untold message</l>
               <l><del rend="overstrike"><add>Spurning at last</add></del></l>
               <l>The sleek, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike"><add place="above" xml:id="a001">affected,</add> </del> soft, gentle screen <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">I've</del> <add place="above" seq="2">I</add></subst> bent<lb/> <del rend="overstrike">below</del> behind <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">too</del> <add place="above" seq="2">so</add></subst> long, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a002"></metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002">at last</add> emerging from;</l>
               <l>Have I no frank confession? what <del rend="overstrike">world</del><lb/> word O <del rend="overstrike">wor</del> <add place="above">soul</add> heart ! O world <add place="above">year</add>!</l>
            </lg>
            <lg type="linegroup">
               <l>The <add place="above">old</add> <del rend="overstrike">affected</del> sugar'd praise I <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">gave</del> <add place="above" seq="2">crown'd</add></subst> thee <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">long</del> <add place="above" seq="2">long</add></subst><lb/> <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">now</del> <add place="above" seq="2">now</add></subst> left, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">aside</del> <del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">off</add></del></subst> <del rend="overstrike">altogether</del></l>
               <l>Nor affectation, year, <add hand="#h01" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a003">for once,</add> for thee or me.</l>
            </lg>
         </lg>
         <pb facs="loc.00077.002.jpg" xml:id="leaf001v" type="verso"/>
      </body>
